    --FW_primer "GTGYCAGCMGCCGCGGTAA" \
    --RV_primer "GGACTACNVGGGTWTCTAAT" \
    --outdir <OUTDIR>
 ```
 
-> [!NOTE]
-> Using a samplesheet will increase input flexibility and options considerably.
